% Gravity tree accuracy, 'sinks' variant: isodisk IC, whose central black hole is a
% Type-5 sink, with SINK_CALC_DISTANCES: the distance from every cell to the nearest sink
% (Sink_Distance) is gathered on the walk and must not depend on the opening criterion.
% Run twice by test_gravtree.py: with the opening criterion below, and converged towards
% direct summation (ErrTolTheta=0.15, ErrTolForceAcc=1e-6); the per-particle difference is
% the production tree error.
InitCondFile                       ../isodisk/isodisk_ics
OutputDir                          output_sinks
TimeMax                            2e-5
BoxSize                            200
TimeBetSnapshot                    2e-5
MaxSizeTimestep                    0.0005
DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.1
UnitLength_in_cm                   3.085678e+21
UnitMass_in_g                      1.989e+43
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s           100000
SofteningGas                       0.001
Softening_Type1                    0.05
Softening_Type2                    0.1
Softening_Type3                    0.1
Softening_Type4                    0.001
Softening_Type5                    0.005
SofteningGasMaxPhys                0.001
Softening_Type1_MaxPhysLimit       0.05
Softening_Type2_MaxPhysLimit       0.1
Softening_Type3_MaxPhysLimit       0.1
Softening_Type4_MaxPhysLimit       0.001
Softening_Type5_MaxPhysLimit       0.005
MinGasTemp                         10
InitGasTemp                        1e4
CritPhysDensity                    10.
SfEffPerFreeFall                   1.0
InitMetallicity                    0.1
InitStellarAge                     0.001
MinSizeTimestep                    1e-15
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.01
CourantFac                         0.2
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.1
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.001
ErrTolTheta                        0.7
TimeBetStatistics                  0.5
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
DomainBuild_ActiveFraction         0.005

SeedSinkMass                       1.0e-7
SinkAccretionFactor                1.0
SinkEddingtonFactor                1.0
SinkNgbFactor                      3.0
SinkMaxAccretionRadius             0.02
SinkRadiativeEfficiency            0.1
SinkFeedbackFactor                 1.0
